    "%@ Bar off" : {
      "comment" : "Profile preview summary fragment: the Thaw Bar is disabled. %@ is the app name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 工具栏关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ Bar on" : {
      "comment" : "Profile preview summary fragment: the Thaw Bar is enabled. %@ is the app name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 工具栏开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ Groups always move together, so no items were moved." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation shown when a whole-group move was refused",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 组总是一起移动，因此没有项目被移动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ The groups are in the menu bar now, but they will not come back after a restart." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 这些组现在位于菜单栏中，但重新启动后不会恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ The menu bar shows it now, but it will be back to the last saved appearance after %@ restarts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ The menu bar shows it now, but it will be back to the last saved appearance after %2$@ restarts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 菜单栏现在显示，但%@ 重新启动后会恢复为上次保存的外观。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ The settings below are in effect now, but they will be back to their last saved values after a restart." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 以下设置现在生效，但重新启动后将恢复为上次保存的值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ The spacers below are in the menu bar now, but they will not come back after a restart." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 下面的间隔项现在位于菜单栏中，但重新启动后不会恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ and %lld more" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ and %2$lld more"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 和 %lld 更多"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ appeared" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 已出现"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ appeared when its app started" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 在所属应用启动时出现"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ are behind the notch. Move them to Hidden and they open from the %@ Bar instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ are behind the notch. Move them to Hidden and they open from the %2$@ Bar instead."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 在刘海后面。将它们移至隐藏，然后从 %@ 工具栏打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ are running, but %@ can't see their menu bar items, so it can't hide or arrange them. Relaunching %@ fixes this." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ are running, but %2$@ can't see their menu bar items, so it can't hide or arrange them. Relaunching %3$@ fixes this."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 正在运行，但%@ 看不到它们的菜单栏项目，因此它无法隐藏或排列它们。重新启动 %@ 可以修复此问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ can check for updates automatically. You can also check manually from the menu bar or Settings %@ About." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ can check for updates automatically. You can also check manually from the menu bar or Settings %2$@ About."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 可以自动检查更新。你也可以从菜单栏或“设置 %@ 关于”手动检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ can keep Live Activities and the camera indicator on the menu bar while apps are hidden, and stop hidden items from flashing when Notification Center opens. It's still in beta because it has had limited testing, but it's promising. You can change this any time in Settings > Layout, under Hiding method." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 可以在隐藏应用时将实时活动和相机指示器保留在菜单栏上，并在通知中心打开时阻止隐藏项目闪烁。由于测试有限，它仍处于测试阶段，但它很有希望。你可以随时在“设置”>“布局”中的“隐藏方法”下更改此设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ can only see clicks that land on the menu bar. An item you open with a keyboard shortcut, or that does its job without ever being clicked, will show up here, and that does not make it unused." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 只能看到位于菜单栏上的点按。你使用键盘快捷键打开的项目，或者无需点按即可完成其工作的项目，将显示在此处，但这并不意味着它不会被使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ can't arrange items while macOS auto-hides the menu bar. Turn that off in System Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the auto-hide pill; %@ is the app name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当 macOS 自动隐藏菜单栏时，%@ 无法排列项目。在系统设置中将其关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ can't hide Apple's %@ icon. This swaps it for a %@ icon in the same place that does the same things and can be moved to Hidden like any other. The original comes back when you turn this off or quit %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ can't hide Apple's %2$@ icon. This swaps it for a %3$@ icon in the same place that does the same things and can be moved to Hidden like any other. The original comes back when you turn this off or quit %4$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 无法隐藏 Apple 的 %@ 图标。这会将其替换为同一位置的 %@ 图标，该图标执行相同的操作，并且可以像其他图标一样移动到隐藏状态。当你关闭此功能或退出 %@ 时，原来的项目会恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ can't tell which Space is showing right now, so these controls are off. Switch to another Space and back to try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 无法判断当前正在显示哪个空间，因此这些控件处于关闭状态。切换到另一个空间并返回重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ cannot arrange menu bar items in automatically hidden menu bars." : {
      "comment" : "A view that shows a message when the menu bar layout can't be arranged in automatically hidden menu bars.",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ nemůže uspořádat položky v automaticky skrývaných řádcích nabídek."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ kann Menüleisten-Einträge in automatisch versteckten Menüs nicht anordnen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ no puede organizar los elementos de la barra de menús en barras ocultas automáticamente."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ ne peut pas réorganiser les éléments de la barre des menus lorsque celle-ci est masquée automatiquement."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ nem tudja rendezni a menüsor elemeit az automatikusan elrejtett menüsorokban."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ tidak dapat menyusun item di bar menu tersembunyi secara otomatis."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ non può disporre le voci della barra dei menu nelle barre dei menu nascoste automaticamente."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ は自動的に非表示になるメニューバーではメニューバー項目を整理できません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@은(는) 자동으로 숨겨진 메뉴 막대에서 항목을 정렬할 수 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ kan geen menubalkitems rangschikken in automatisch verborgen menubalken."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ nie może zmienić układu elementów na pasku menu, gdy jest on automatycznie ukrywany."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ não pode organizar itens da barra de menus quando ela está configurada para ocultação automática."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ не может упорядочивать элементы в автоматически скрываемых строках меню."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ ไม่สามารถจัดเรียงรายการเมนูในแถบเมนูบาร์ที่ซ่อนโดยอัตโนมัติได้"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ otomatik gizlenen menü çubuklarında öğeleri düzenleyemez."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ не може впорядковувати об'єкти в автоматично прихованих рядках меню."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ không thể sắp xếp các mục thanh menu trong các thanh menu ẩn tự động."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 无法在自动隐藏菜单栏中排列项目。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 無法在自動隱藏的選單列中排列項目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ cannot edit the appearance of automatically hidden menu bars." : {
      "comment" : "A view that appears when the user tries to edit the appearance of a menu bar that the system has hidden automatically.",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ nemůže spravovat vzhled  automaticky skrývaných řádků nabídek."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ kann die Darstellung von automatisch versteckten Menüleisten nicht anpassen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ no puede editar la apariencia de las barras ocultas automáticamente."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ ne peut pas modifier l'apparence de la barre des menus lorsqu'elle est masquée automatiquement."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ nem tudja szerkeszteni az automatikusan elrejtett menüsorok megjelenését."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ tidak dapat mengedit tampilan menu bar tersembunyi secara otomatis."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ non può modificare l'aspetto delle barre dei menu nascoste automaticamente."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ は自動的に非表示になるメニューバーの外観を編集できません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@은(는) 자동으로 숨겨진 메뉴 막대의 모양을 편집할 수 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ kan het uiterlijk van automatisch verborgen menubalken niet bewerken"
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ nie może edytować wyglądu automatycznie ukrywanych pasków menu."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ não pode editar a aparência da barra de menus quando ela está configurada para ocultação automática."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ не может изменять внешний вид автоматически скрываемых строк меню."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ ไม่สามารถแก้ไขลักษณะของแถบเมนูที่ซ่อนโดยอัตโนมัติได้"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ otomatik gizlenen menü çubuklarının görünümünü düzenleyemez."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ не може редагувати вигляд автоматично прихованих рядків меню."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ không thể chỉnh sửa hình thức của thanh menu ẩn tự động."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 无法修改自动隐藏菜单栏的外观。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 無法編輯自動隱藏選單列的外觀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ can’t change the look of a menu bar that macOS hides automatically." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 无法更改 macOS 自动隐藏的菜单栏的外观。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ collects no analytics or usage data. Permission checks stay on your Mac. The only network calls are the ones listed below, and each has a switch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 不收集任何分析或使用数据。权限检查保留在你的 Mac 上。唯一的网络调用是下面列出的，每个都有一个开关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ could not open a second copy of itself, so it stayed open and nothing changed. Quit and open it again to finish." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 无法打开自身的第二个副本，因此没有更改。请退出后重新打开，以完成操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ couldn't confirm the items left the menu bar, so it put them back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 无法确认离开菜单栏的项目，因此将其放回原处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ couldn't measure where your items sit in the menu bar, so the overlay stayed off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 无法测量你的项目在菜单栏中的位置，因此叠加层保持关闭状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ couldn’t load the bundled acknowledgements document." : {
      "comment" : "Fallback when the acknowledgements RTF is missing. Placeholder is the app name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 无法加载捆绑的确认文档。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ couldn’t load the bundled release notes." : {
      "comment" : "Fallback in the release-notes sheet; placeholder is the app name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 无法加载捆绑的发行说明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ couldn’t load the release notes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 无法加载发行说明。"
