            "value" : "5 分钟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A backup holds macOS's saved menu bar layout and the per-Mac preference files a positions reset deletes. It does not hold %@'s own settings, profiles, or which section an item is in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "备份保存 macOS 保存的菜单栏布局以及位置重置删除的每台 Mac 的偏好设置文件。它不保存 %@ 自己的设置、配置方案或项目所在的分区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A backup holds the system's saved item positions: the table the menu bar host reads, and the per-Mac preference files a layout reset deletes. It does not hold %@'s own settings, profiles, or which section an item is in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "备份保存系统保存的项目位置：菜单栏主机读取的表，以及布局重置删除的每台 Mac 的偏好设置文件。它不保存 %@ 自己的设置、配置方案或项目所在的分区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A click on the %@ icon trades your shown and hidden items instead of revealing the hidden ones. Click again to swap back. Option-click and right-click keep their usual actions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按 %@ 图标会交换显示和隐藏的项目，而不是显示隐藏项目。再次点按即可交换回来。Option 点按和右键点按仍执行原来的操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A click on the Thaw icon trades your shown and hidden items instead of revealing the hidden ones. Click again to swap back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按 Thaw 图标会交换显示和隐藏的项目，而不是显示隐藏项目。再次点按即可交换回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A click on the Thaw icon trades your shown and hidden items instead of revealing the hidden ones. Click again to swap back. Option-click and right-click keep their usual actions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按 Thaw 图标会交换显示和隐藏的项目，而不是显示隐藏项目。再次点按即可交换回来。Option 点按和右键点按仍执行原来的操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A custom icon in the menu bar" : {
