    "Accessibility and Screen Recording permissions will be cleared for %@. The app will quit so you can grant them again on next launch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 的辅助功能和屏幕录制权限将被清除。该应用将退出，以便你可以在下次启动时再次授予它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility is all Simple Mode needs. Arranging, groups, and hiding work without Screen Recording; adding it draws your real icons in Layout, the %@ Bar, and Search." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "简单模式只需要辅助功能权限。无需“屏幕录制”即可排列、分组和隐藏；授予该权限后，布局、%@ 工具栏和搜索中会显示真实图标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility is all Simple Mode needs. Arranging, groups, and hiding work without Screen Recording; adding it draws your real icons in the Layout editor, the Bar, and Search." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "简单模式只需要辅助功能权限。无需“屏幕录制”即可排列、分组和隐藏；授予该权限后，布局编辑器、工具栏和搜索中会显示真实图标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
