    "Allowed apps can read and change most settings, such as how sections show and hide, the %@ Bar, and per-display options." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许的应用可以读取和更改大多数设置，例如分区的显示和隐藏方式、%@ 工具栏和每个显示器的选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allowed apps can read settings, toggle boolean options, set numeric values (timers, delays), change enum settings (rehide strategy, %@ Bar location), and modify per-display configurations. This includes auto-rehide, show on click/hover/scroll/double-click, %@ Bar, hide application menus, enable always-hidden section, show tooltips, and diagnostic logging." : {
      "comment" : "A description of what allowed apps can do.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许的应用可以读取设置、切换布尔选项、设置数值（计时器、延迟）、更改枚举设置（重新隐藏策略、%@ 工具栏位置）以及修改每个显示器的配置。这包括自动重新隐藏、点按/悬停/滚动/双击时显示、%@ 工具栏、隐藏应用菜单、启用始终隐藏的分区、显示工具提示和诊断日志记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allows items such as Clock, Control Center, and Siri to be moved into hidden sections." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许将时钟、控制中心和 Siri 等项目移至隐藏分区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
