    "Ask on Discord" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Discord 上提问"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask us about anything on this page: what %@ reads, what it writes, why it asks for a permission, or how it moves your items. We are open to any question about privacy, and every one gets an answer from a person." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "向我们询问有关此页面上的任何信息：%@ 读取什么、写入什么、为什么请求许可，或者它如何移动你的项目。我们对任何有关隐私的问题持打开态度，每个问题都会得到专人的解答。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask us about anything on this page: what Thaw reads, what it writes, why it asks for a permission, or what a move just did. We are open to any question about privacy, and every one gets an answer from a person." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "向我们询问此页面上的任何内容：Thaw 读了什么、写了什么、为什么需要许可，或者刚刚做了什么动作。我们对任何有关隐私的问题持打开态度，每个问题都会得到专人的解答。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asks %@ whether a newer version exists." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "询问 %@ 是否存在更新的版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asks the update server whether a newer version exists. The only network call Thaw makes on its own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "询问更新服务器是否有新版本。这是 Thaw 主动发起的唯一网络调用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
