    "Assigns a profile to the Space you are currently on. Spaces have no system name, so each assignment is labeled by its Mission Control position at the time you made it. A Space assignment takes precedence over a display assignment; a Focus Filter still overrides both." : {
      "comment" : "Footer for the \"Per-Space Profiles\" section in the profile settings pane.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将配置方案分配给你当前所在的空间。空间没有系统名称，因此每个任务都按你分配时的 Mission Control 位置进行标记。空间分配优先于显示分配；专注模式过滤器仍然会覆盖两者。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
