        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click to show hidden items and right-click for settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按以显示隐藏的项目，然后右键点按进行设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click to show hidden items, double-click for Always Hidden, and right-click for settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按可显示隐藏项目，双击可始终隐藏，右键点按可进行设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click to show hidden items, double-click for always-hidden, and right-click for settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按可显示隐藏项目，双击可始终隐藏，右键点按可进行设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click to swap shown and hidden items and right-click for settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按可交换显示和隐藏的项目，然后右键点按进行设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click to swap shown and hidden items, double-click for Always Hidden, and right-click for settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按可交换显示和隐藏的项目，双击“始终隐藏”，然后右键点按进行设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click, hover, scroll or a hotkey" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按、悬停、滚动或热键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click, hover, scroll or a keyboard shortcut" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按、悬停、滚动或键盘快捷键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clicking a hidden item shows it in the menu bar and opens its menu under the icon. Turn off to open the menu without showing the icon." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按隐藏项目会在菜单栏中显示它，并在图标下方打开菜单。关闭此选项后，只打开菜单，不显示图标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clicking the desktop puts the Finder's menus in the bar. This covers them until you switch to something else. The Apple menu stays, and Finder windows keep their menus.\n\nThe cover is a capture of what sits behind the bar, so it matches your wallpaper. Without Screen Recording it falls back to a flat patch of the bar's average color, which can show against the wallpaper." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按桌面会将访达菜单放入菜单栏。这些菜单会一直保留，直到你切换到其他应用。Apple 菜单不受影响，访达窗口也会保留自己的菜单。\n\n覆盖层截取菜单栏后方的内容，因此会匹配你的壁纸。没有“屏幕录制”权限时，会改用菜单栏平均颜色的纯色区域，在壁纸上可能比较明显。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clock, Control Center, Siri, Weather, Battery and the rest will not respond to dragging while this is off. Turn it on to move them, and expect the occasional item that refuses or returns on its own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时钟、控制中心、Siri、天气、电池等在关闭时不会响应拖动。打开它来移动它们，并预期偶尔会有项目拒绝或自行返回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close and reopen this window to try again. If the bars stay empty, quit %@ and open it again." : {
