    "Delete macOS's saved menu bar layout and restart the menu bar so it rebuilds from scratch. Use this when items won't come back to the menu bar after you move them. A backup is saved first; restore it from Layout backups above." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除 macOS 保存的菜单栏布局并重新启动菜单栏，以便它从头开始重建。当项目在移动后不会返回到菜单栏时，请使用此选项。首先保存备份；从上面的布局备份中恢复布局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete this backup?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除这个备份吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deletes every saved item position and restarts the system's menu bar service, so the layout rebuilds from scratch. Thaw saves a backup first. Use this when items won't return to the menu bar after you rearrange." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除每个保存的项目位置并重新启动系统的菜单栏服务，以便从头开始重建布局。Thaw 首先保存备份。当重新排列后项目不会返回到菜单栏时，请使用此选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
