    "Diagnostics and Onboarding are non-destructive. Reset and Troubleshooting can delete settings, clear the cache, or quit apps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "诊断和引导流程不会删除数据。重置和故障排除可能删除设置、清除缓存或退出应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
