    "Each time %@ moves a menu bar item, the move is listed here, the same record the diagnostic log keeps. Moves happen only when you reorder. The list lives in memory only and is never saved to disk or sent anywhere." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次 %@ 移动菜单栏项目时，移动都会在此处列出，诊断日志保留相同的记录。仅当你重新排序时才会发生移动。该列表仅存在于内存中，永远不会保存到磁盘或发送到任何地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Early ideas you can try before they are finished. Anything here can change or break between releases, and some of it may go away for good. Turning an experiment off puts %@ back to normal." : {
      "comment" : "Message of The Lab intro pill.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可以在功能完成前尝试早期版本。这里的任何内容都可能在版本之间发生变化或中断，并且其中一些可能会永远消失。关闭实验会使 %@ 恢复正常。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Early ideas you can try before they are finished. Anything here can change or break between releases, and some of it may go away for good. Turning an experiment off puts %@ back to normal.\n\nFeedback is what decides which of these graduate and which are dropped, so tell us how they go: which experiment, what you expected, and what happened instead. Either place reaches us." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可以在功能完成前尝试早期版本。这里的任何内容都可能在版本之间发生变化或中断，并且其中一些可能会永远消失。关闭实验会使 %@ 恢复正常。\n\n反馈决定了哪些功能会继续保留、哪些会被舍弃，所以请告诉我们他们的进展如何：哪个实验、你的期望以及发生了什么。任一入口都能联系我们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Early ideas. They can change, break, or go away between releases. Turning one off puts %@ back to normal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "早期功能可能在版本之间变化、失效或移除。关闭某项实验后，%@ 会恢复正常。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Early: the panel shows the sections, zen mode, the active profile and the Swap bar. Everything else stays in the menu, which comes back when this is off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "早期：面板显示各个分区、禅模式、活动配置方案和交换栏。其他所有内容都保留在菜单中，关闭后菜单会返回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
