    "Enter Zen Mode while presenting" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "演示时进入禅模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter or leave Zen Mode, which hides the menu bar entirely." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "进入或退出禅模式。禅模式会完全隐藏菜单栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter zen mode while presenting" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "演示时进入禅模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enters Zen Mode while the camera or microphone is in use, so a cluttered bar stays out of a screen recording or call, then restores it when recording stops. Works alongside Zen Mode while presenting. While a recording is live, turning Zen Mode off by hand puts it back within a second." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用摄像头或麦克风时进入禅模式，让杂乱的菜单栏不出现在屏幕录制或通话中；录制停止后恢复菜单栏。演示时可与禅模式配合使用。录制过程中手动关闭禅模式后，菜单栏会在 1 秒内恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enters Zen Mode while the camera or microphone is in use, then restores the bar when recording stops." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用摄像头或麦克风时进入禅模式，录制停止后恢复工具栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enters zen mode while the camera or microphone is in use, so a cluttered bar stays out of a screen recording or call, then restores it when recording stops. Works alongside zen mode while presenting. While a recording is live, turning zen mode off by hand puts it back within a second." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用摄像头或麦克风时进入禅模式，让杂乱的菜单栏不出现在屏幕录制或通话中；录制停止后恢复菜单栏。演示时可与禅模式配合使用。录制过程中手动关闭禅模式后，菜单栏会在 1 秒内恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enters zen mode while the camera or microphone is in use, then restores the bar when recording stops." : {
