            "value" : "以太网"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every menu bar item's saved position will be deleted and the menu bar will restart, so your whole arrangement is rebuilt from scratch. A backup is saved first, and Layout backups on this page can put it back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个菜单栏项目的保存位置都将被删除，菜单栏将重新启动，因此你的整个排列将从头开始重建。先保存一个备份，这个页面的布局备份可以恢复布局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every menu bar move is recorded here as the pipeline performs it. These are the same records the diagnostics log writes. Moves happen only when you reorder. Records live in memory only: nothing on this page is saved to disk or sent anywhere." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "管道每次移动菜单栏项目时，都会在这里记录。诊断日志也会写入相同记录。只有重新排序时才会移动项目。记录只保存在内存中：此页面的内容不会写入磁盘或发送到任何地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every option, including layout, profiles, and automation." : {
      "comment" : "Card description for the Full choice during onboarding.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "包括布局、配置方案和自动化在内的所有选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every status item's saved position will be deleted and the system's menu bar host will restart, so your whole menu bar arrangement is rebuilt from scratch. A timestamped backup is saved first, and Layout Backups below can put it back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个状态项目的保存位置都会删除，系统菜单栏主机会重新启动，并从头重建整个菜单栏布局。系统会先保存带时间戳的备份，之后可使用下方的布局备份恢复它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every status item's saved position will be deleted and the system's menu bar host will restart, so your whole menu bar arrangement is rebuilt from scratch. A timestamped backup is saved first, and you can reveal it in Finder afterward." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个状态项目的保存位置都会删除，系统菜单栏主机会重新启动，并从头重建整个菜单栏布局。系统会先保存带时间戳的备份，之后你可以在访达中显示它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything %@ does" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 所做的一切"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything above is stored on this Mac in %@'s own settings, and nowhere else. Turning the experiment off clears it too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上述内容仅存储在此 Mac 的 %@ 设置中。关闭实验也会清除这些内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything is hidden" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有项目都已隐藏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Example: a Before switching script could run `defaults write com.bjango.istatmenus5 ActiveProfile -string \"$THAW_PROFILE_NAME\"` to keep iStat Menus in sync with %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "示例：切换前脚本可以运行 `defaults write com.bjango.istatmenus5 ActiveProfile -string \"$THAW_PROFILE_NAME\"` 以使 iStat 菜单与 %@ 保持同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Example: a bash pre-hook could `defaults write com.bjango.istatmenus5 ActiveProfile -string \"$THAW_PROFILE_NAME\"` to keep iStat Menus in sync with Thaw." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how to use environment variables in a pre-hook.",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Příklad: bashový pre-hook může provést příkaz `defaults write com.bjango.istatmenus5 ActiveProfile -string \"$THAW_PROFILE_NAME\"`, aby se aplikace iStat Menus synchronizovala s Thaw."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beispiel: Ein Bash-Pre-Hook könnte mit `defaults write com.bjango.istatmenus5 ActiveProfile -string \"$THAW_PROFILE_NAME\"` dafür sorgen, dass iStat Menus mit Thaw synchron bleibt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ejemplo: un pre-hook de Bash podría ejecutar `defaults write com.bjango.istatmenus5 ActiveProfile -string «$THAW_PROFILE_NAME»` para mantener iStat Menus sincronizado con Thaw."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
