    "Fetches a new version in the background, or only after you accept an update." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在后台获取新版本，或仅在你接受更新后获取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fetches the latest release notes from %@ when you open What’s New and keeps a copy for offline use. When this is off, What’s New shows the last copy it fetched, if there is one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开“新增内容”时，从 %@ 获取最新发行说明，并保留副本供离线使用。关闭此选项后，“新增内容”会显示上次获取的副本（如果有）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fetches the latest release notes when you open What’s New and keeps a copy for offline use. When this is off, What’s New shows the notes that shipped with this version." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开“新功能”时获取最新发行说明，并保存副本供离线使用。关闭后，“新功能”显示此版本随附的说明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fetches the new version in the background. When this is off, the download starts only after you accept an update." : {
