    "Groups always move and hide together. Drag any member in the bars above to move the whole group." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "组中的项目始终一起移动和隐藏。拖动上方栏中的任一成员即可移动整个组。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hang a small readout below a menu bar item while the pointer rests on it, showing what the item is already reporting in the space the menu bar has no room for. Items that report nothing useful stay as they are." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "指针停留在菜单栏项目上时，在其下方显示小型读数，利用菜单栏没有空间的位置显示项目已有的信息。没有有用信息的项目保持不变。"
