    },
    "Items hidden" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已隐藏项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Items macOS won't show in the menu bar stay in the %@ Bar. Turn this off to treat them as ordinary hidden items. Your list comes back when you turn it on again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 不会在菜单栏中显示的项目会留在 %@ 工具栏中。关闭此选项即可将它们作为普通隐藏项目处理。再次打开后，列表会恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Items macOS won’t show" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 不会显示的项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Items move into place without your pointer moving, because %@ updates macOS's saved menu bar layout. It touches only that one file." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "项目会在指针不动的情况下移动到位，因为 %@ 会更新 macOS 保存的菜单栏布局。它只会操作这一个文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Items shown" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已显示项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Items were moved to the Visible section." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "项目已移到显示分区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Items you have never clicked, and that have been around for a month, would be listed here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你从未点击过、且已存在一个月的项目会列在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Items you open from here show up as recents." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从这里打开的项目会显示为最近项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its app isn’t responding. Restart the app to move this item. Other items may not move reliably until then." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation shown when a drag starts on an item whose app is hung",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其所属应用没有响应。请重新启动应用后再移动此项目。在此之前，其他项目也可能无法可靠移动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s one of Apple’s own items, which macOS keeps in the menu bar unless %@ asks it not to. Turn on “Allow hiding Apple’s own menu bar items” in Settings %@ Layout to move it." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation shown when an Apple item was refused because system item hiding is off",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "It’s one of Apple’s own items, which macOS keeps in the menu bar unless %1$@ asks it not to. Turn on “Allow hiding Apple’s own menu bar items” in Settings %2$@ Layout to move it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是 Apple 自带的项目，除非 %@ 要求隐藏，否则 macOS 会将它保留在菜单栏中。请在设置 %@ 布局中打开“允许隐藏 Apple 自带的菜单栏项目”以移动它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s one of Apple’s own items, which macOS keeps in the menu bar unless Thaw asks it not to. Turn on “Allow hiding Apple’s own menu bar items” below to move it." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation shown when an Apple item was refused because system item hiding is off",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是 Apple 自带的项目，除非 Thaw 要求隐藏，否则 macOS 会将它保留在菜单栏中。请在下方打开“允许隐藏 Apple 自带的菜单栏项目”以移动它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Join the %@ Discord" : {
