    "Keep the %@ Bar pinned in place instead of draggable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "固定 %@ 工具栏的位置，不允许拖动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the %@ Bar pinned in place. Turn off to move it by dragging its background." : {
      "comment" : "Annotation under the lock-position toggle. %@ is the app name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "固定 %@ 工具栏的位置。关闭后可拖动其背景来移动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps Live Activities and the camera indicator on the menu bar while apps are hidden, and stops hidden items from flashing when Notification Center opens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用隐藏时，让实时活动和相机指示器保留在菜单栏中，并阻止通知中心打开时隐藏项目闪烁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps Live Activities and the camera indicator on the menu bar while apps are hidden, and stops hidden items from flashing when Notification Center opens. While it's on, macOS may show the screen recording indicator when %@ updates item pictures." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用隐藏时，让实时活动和相机指示器保留在菜单栏中，并阻止通知中心打开时隐藏项目闪烁。开启后，%@ 更新项目图片时，macOS 可能会显示屏幕录制指示器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps Live Activities and the camera indicator visible while apps are hidden, and helps with hidden items flashing when Notification Center opens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用隐藏时，让实时活动和相机指示器保持显示，并减少通知中心打开时隐藏项目闪烁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps a list of when items appeared in and disappeared from your menu bar, so \"when did this show up?\" has an answer. Stored on this Mac in %@'s own settings and nowhere else, and cleared when you turn this off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "记录项目何时出现在菜单栏中、何时从菜单栏消失，这样就能回答“它是什么时候出现的？”。记录只存储在这台 Mac 的 %@ 自有设置中，不会存储在其他位置；关闭此选项后会清除记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps an item macOS won’t draw reachable in the %@ Bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让 macOS 不会绘制的项目仍可在 %@ 工具栏中访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps the group's items in Hidden and puts a folder icon in the menu bar that opens them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将组中的项目保留在隐藏中，并在菜单栏中放置一个可打开这些项目的文件夹图标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
