        }
      }
    },
    "Moves your menu bar items out of the system menu bar and into a Thaw strip that appears when you point at the space they left. The bar keeps its app menus, clock, and system modules. Items go back to the menu bar when you turn this off or when %@ quits." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将菜单栏项目移出系统菜单栏，放入指向其原位置时出现的 Thaw 栏。该栏保留应用菜单、时钟和系统模块。关闭此选项或 %@ 退出后，项目会回到菜单栏。"
