        }
      }
    },
    "Shown when %@ has no picture of the item, which is always the case for a Thaw Bar Only item." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当 %@ 没有项目图片时显示。仅 Thaw 工具栏项目始终属于这种情况。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shown, hidden and always hidden" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示、隐藏和始终隐藏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows a banner when an app starts using your microphone, naming the app, and another when a camera turns on. macOS doesn't tell anyone which app is using a camera, so that one says only that it's in use. While either is on, %@'s menu lists what's using it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用开始使用麦克风时显示横幅并标出应用名称，摄像头开启时显示另一个横幅。macOS 不会告知具体哪个应用正在使用摄像头，因此摄像头横幅只会说明摄像头正在使用中。任一横幅显示时，%@ 的菜单都会列出正在使用它的项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows an icon in the menu bar while there are Thaw Bar Only items. Click it to open a small %@ Bar with just those items." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有仅 Thaw 工具栏项目时，在菜单栏显示图标。点按图标，打开只包含这些项目的小型 %@ 工具栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows only the essential settings. All features keep working and keep their configuration." : {
