    "Swap in progress" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在交换"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swap isn't ready yet. Try again in a moment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "交换尚未准备好。请稍后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swap moves the hidden items onto the menu bar and the shown ones off, each group in its own order, until you swap back. It is a real layout change, so it stays that way through a relaunch. The Swap Bar sits under the menu bar on the display your pointer is on, beside the active profile, the section toggles, and Zen Mode, and never takes focus from the app you are in. Right-click the menu bar, a keyboard shortcut, or a Shortcuts action reach the same swap without it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "交换会将隐藏项目移到菜单栏，并将显示项目移出，每组都保持自己的顺序，直到你交换回来。这是真正的布局更改，因此重新启动后仍会保持。交换栏位于指针所在显示器的菜单栏下方，旁边是当前配置方案、分区开关和禅模式，并且不会抢占当前应用的焦点。右键点按菜单栏、使用键盘快捷键或快捷指令操作，也能执行同样的交换，无需打开交换栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swap not applied" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "交换未应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swap order not applied" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "交换顺序未应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swap shown and hidden" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "交换显示和隐藏项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swap shown and hidden items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "交换显示和隐藏的项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swap the shown and hidden menu bar items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "交换显示和隐藏的菜单栏项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swap trades your shown and hidden items until you swap back. The Swap bar sits under the menu bar with the swap, the active profile, section toggles, and zen mode. Also in the menu bar right-click menu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "交换会调换显示和隐藏的项目，直到你交换回来。交换栏位于菜单栏下方，包含交换按钮、当前配置方案、分区开关和禅模式。菜单栏右键菜单中也有此操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swap trades your shown and hidden items: the hidden ones move onto the bar and the shown ones move off, each group in its own order, until you swap back. It is a real layout change, so it stays that way through a relaunch. The Swap bar sits just under the menu bar on the display your pointer is on, with the swap one click away beside the active profile, the section toggles, and zen mode. It never takes focus from the app you are in. Right-click the menu bar, a hotkey, or a Shortcuts action reach the same swap without it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "交换会调换显示和隐藏的项目：隐藏项目移到工具栏，显示项目移出，每组都保持自己的顺序，直到你交换回来。这是真正的布局更改，因此重新启动后仍会保持。交换栏位于指针所在显示器的菜单栏正下方，交换按钮就在当前配置方案、分区开关和禅模式旁边，点按一次即可操作。它不会抢占当前应用的焦点。右键点按菜单栏、使用快捷键或快捷指令操作，也能执行同样的交换，无需打开交换栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swap unavailable" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "交换不可用"
          }
        }
