            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Значок %@ должен всегда оставаться в видимой секции."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ไอคอน %@ ต้องคงอยู่ในส่วนที่มองเห็นได้เสมอ"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ simgesi her zaman görünür bölümde kalmalıdır."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Значок %@ повинен завжди залишатися у видимому розділі."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Biểu tượng %@ phải luôn ở trong phần hiển thị."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 图标必须始终保留在“显示”分区。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 圖示必須始終保留在顯示區域中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Lab" : {
      "comment" : "Sidebar and search title of The Lab pane.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "实验室"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The active Space is still settling. Switch to it again to assign a profile." : {
      "comment" : "Shown in the profile settings pane when the active Space cannot be resolved yet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "活动空间仍在稳定。请再次切换到此空间以分配配置方案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent's layout table is protected. Grant Full Disk Access above to compare it against Thaw's saved layout." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "代理的布局表受到保护。请在上方授予“完全磁盘访问权限”，以便将它与 Thaw 保存的布局进行比较。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent's table (by weight)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "代理的表（按权重）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The amount of time to wait before hiding temporarily shown menu bar items." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隐藏临时显示的菜单栏项目之前要等待的时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The amount of time to wait before showing a tooltip over a menu bar item." : {
      "comment" : "Label for a slider that controls the delay before showing a tooltip over a menu bar item.",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prodleva, než se nad ikonou v liště Thaw zobrazí popisek."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Zeitversatz bevor ein Tooltip über einem Menüleisteneintrag angezeigt wird."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El tiempo de espera antes de mostrar un tooltip sobre un elemento de la barra de menús."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Temps d'attente avant d'afficher une infobulle au-dessus d'un élément de la barre des menus."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A várakozási idő, mielőtt eszköztipp jelenik meg egy menüsávelem felett."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Durasi tunggu sebelum tip alat ditampilkan saat kursor diarahkan ke item bar menu."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tempo di attesa prima di visualizzare un suggerimento su una voce della barra dei menu."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "メニューバー項目のツールチップを表示するまでの待機時間。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "메뉴 막대 항목 위에 툴팁이 표시되기까지의 지연 시간입니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De tijd die moet verstrijken voordat er een tooltip boven een menu-item wordt weergegeven."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Czas oczekiwania na wyświetlenie podpowiedzi nad elementem paska menu."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O tempo de espera antes de exibir uma dica sobre um item da barra de menus."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Время ожидания перед показом подсказки над элементом строки меню."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ระยะเวลาที่ต้องรอก่อนแสดงคำแนะนำเหนือรายการแถบเมนู"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Menü çubuğu öğesinin üzerinde ipucu göstermeden önce beklenmesi gereken süre."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Час очікування перед показом підказки над об'єктом рядка меню."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Khoảng thời gian chờ đợi trước khi hiển thị chú giải công cụ trên một mục trên thanh menu."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示菜单栏项目提示框前的等待时长。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在選單列項目上顯示提示前的等待時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The amount of time to wait before showing on hover." : {
      "comment" : "Label for the slider that controls the amount of time to wait before showing on hover.",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prodleva, než se skryté ikony zobrazí po najetí myši."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Zeit, die gewartet wird, bevor beim Darüberschweben Menüleisten-Einträge angezeigt werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tiempo de espera antes de mostrar al pasar el cursor."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Délai d’attente avant affichage suite au survol de la souris. "
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A várakozási idő a rámutatásos megjelenítés előtt."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Durasi tunggu sebelum ditampilkan saat kursor diarahkan."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tempo di attesa prima che venga visualizzato al passaggio del mouse."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ホバー表示するまでの待機時間。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "마우스 오버 시 표시하기 전까지의 지연 시간입니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De tijd die moet worden gewacht voordat het wordt weergegeven bij het aanwijzen met de muis."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Czas oczekiwania na wyświetlenie elementu po wskazaniu go kursorem myszy."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O tempo de espera antes de aparecer ao passar o cursor."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Время ожидания перед показом при наведении."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ระยะเวลาที่รอ ก่อนแสดงเมื่อวางเมาส์ทับซ้อน"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Üzerine gelindiğinde göstermeden önce beklenmesi gereken süre."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Час очікування перед показом при наведенні."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lượng thời gian chờ đợi trước khi hiển thị khi di chuột."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鼠标悬停前等待的时间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "懸停後顯示前的等待時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The custom status icon reads the connection type from macOS on this Mac. It does not contact a server or send network details, and it stops reading when you turn the custom status icon off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自定义状态图标从此 Mac 的 macOS 读取连接类型。它不会联系服务器或发送网络详情，关闭自定义状态图标后也会停止读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The drag never touches your pointer: the cursor is hidden and physical mouse input is held while the item is moved into place." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拖动过程不会接触指针：移动项目到指定位置时，指针会隐藏，实体鼠标输入会被暂时锁定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file the menu bar host reads is in a protected container. Without Full Disk Access, a backup can only hold the older preference files beside it. Grant it on the Privacy page to back up and restore the whole layout." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "菜单栏主机读取的文件位于受保护的容器中。没有“完全磁盘访问权限”时，备份只能保存旁边较旧的偏好设置文件。请在“隐私”页面授予权限，以备份和恢复完整布局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The full-screen menu bar appearance could not be applied." : {
      "comment" : "Failure message shown when applying the full-screen menu bar appearance fails, in the Spaces settings pane.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法应用全屏菜单栏外观。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hover reveal setting could not be changed for this Space." : {
      "comment" : "Failure message shown when changing the hover reveal setting for a Space fails, in the Spaces settings pane.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法更改此空间的悬停显示设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The item stays while %@ runs and returns automatically at launch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 运行期间项目会保持显示，并在启动时自动恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The item stays while %@ runs and returns automatically at launch. Click it for its readings or to open Network Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 运行期间项目会保持显示，并在启动时自动恢复。点按它查看读数或打开网络设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language change applies after %@ relaunches." : {
      "comment" : "Note shown after changing the app language. %@ is the app name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语言更改会在 %@ 重新启动后生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The least time that passes before the same item can reveal itself again, so an icon that animates continuously can’t bounce in and out of the menu bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一项目再次显示前必须经过的最短时间，防止持续动画的图标反复进出菜单栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The look covers the whole menu bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "外观覆盖整个菜单栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The menu bar agent refused that change" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the warning pill shown when a per-Space or all-Spaces menu bar command fails, in the Spaces settings pane.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "菜单栏代理拒绝了此更改"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The menu bar could not be hidden across all Spaces." : {
      "comment" : "Failure message shown when hiding the menu bar everywhere fails, in the Spaces settings pane.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法在所有空间中隐藏菜单栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The menu bar is set to hide itself" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the Simple Mode pill shown while macOS auto-hides the menu bar.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "菜单栏已设置为自动隐藏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The open source menu bar manager for macOS" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 的开源菜单栏管理器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The other center symbols are decorative." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其他中心符号仅用于装饰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The panel opens in the middle of the screen, the way Spotlight does, showing the items you used recently until you start typing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "面板会像 Spotlight 一样在屏幕中央打开。在你开始输入前，它会显示最近使用的项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The panel opens in the spot you last dragged it to, one per display, listing every item by section." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "面板会在上次拖动到的位置打开。每个显示器各有一个面板，并按分区列出所有项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The panel opens next to the pointer with large rows and large type, listing every item, so you can pick one by reading and clicking instead of aiming at the menu bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "面板会在指针旁打开，使用大行和大字体列出所有项目。你可以阅读并点按项目，无需瞄准菜单栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The panel shows the sections, Zen Mode, the active profile and the Swap Bar. Everything else stays in the menu, which comes back when this is off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "面板显示分区、禅模式、当前配置方案和交换栏。其他内容保留在菜单中，关闭此选项后会恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The panel shows the sections, zen mode, the active profile and the Swap bar. Everything else stays in the menu, which comes back when this is off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "面板显示分区、禅模式、当前配置方案和交换栏。其他内容保留在菜单中，关闭此选项后会恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pointer's screen follows wherever you're working. Pinning the banner to a display shows it there even when the pointer is somewhere else, which is the point when the camera turns on while you're not at the machine. If that display isn't connected, the main display is used." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "指针所在的屏幕会随你的工作位置变化。将横幅固定到某个显示器后，即使指针位于其他位置，横幅也会显示在那里；当你不在 Mac 前而摄像头开启时，这一功能很有用。如果该显示器未连接，则使用主显示器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The profile's settings were applied, but its menu bar arrangement was not: %@ is not managing the menu bar yet. Apply it again once the menu bar is under %@'s control." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The profile's settings were applied, but its menu bar arrangement was not: %1$@ is not managing the menu bar yet. Apply it again once the menu bar is under %2$@'s control."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "配置方案的设置已应用，但菜单栏排列未应用：%@ 尚未管理菜单栏。菜单栏由 %@ 控制后，请再次应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The repository could not be reached, so this is the last copy fetched." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法访问代码仓库，因此这是最后一次获取的副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reveal strip height could not be applied to this Space." : {
      "comment" : "Failure message shown when setting the reveal strip height fails, in the Spaces settings pane.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法将显示条高度应用到此空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved positions in it are gone for good. This does not change your current menu bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其中保存的位置已永久丢失。这不会更改当前菜单栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved positions in this backup replace the ones in use now. %@ backs up the current positions first, so you can restore your way back. The menu bar restarts, and %@ has to relaunch afterward." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The saved positions in this backup replace the ones in use now. %1$@ backs up the current positions first, so you can restore your way back. The menu bar restarts, and %2$@ has to relaunch afterward."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此备份中保存的位置会替换当前使用的位置。%@ 会先备份当前位置，以便你恢复回来。菜单栏会重新启动，之后 %@ 也必须重新启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved positions in this backup replace the ones in use now. %@ backs up the current positions first, so you can restore your way back. The system's menu bar host restarts, and %@ has to relaunch afterward." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The saved positions in this backup replace the ones in use now. %1$@ backs up the current positions first, so you can restore your way back. The system's menu bar host restarts, and %2$@ has to relaunch afterward."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此备份中保存的位置会替换当前使用的位置。%@ 会先备份当前位置，以便你恢复回来。系统的菜单栏主机会重新启动，之后 %@ 也必须重新启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The section dividers are not on the menu bar yet" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "分区分隔线尚未显示在菜单栏中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The system's layout table" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统布局表"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The table is one file inside MenuBarAgent’s protected container (~/Library/Group Containers/com.apple.MenuBar). Thaw reads it to place items and writes it only when you reorder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此表是 MenuBarAgent 受保护容器（~/Library/Group Containers/com.apple.MenuBar）中的一个文件。Thaw 读取它来放置项目，只在你重新排序时写入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The widget preview reads connection type from macOS locally. It does not contact a server or send network details. Monitoring runs only while the widget item is enabled in Widgets." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "小组件预览在本地从 macOS 读取连接类型。它不会联系服务器或发送网络详情。只有在“​​小组件”中启用小组件项目时，监控才会运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are sample readings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些是示例读数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These controls last for this session" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the notice explaining that the Spaces settings pane's controls do not persist across quits.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些控制仅在本次会话中有效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These controls need macOS 27 or later. %@'s other menu bar features work as usual." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些控制需要 macOS 27 或更高版本。%@ 的其他菜单栏功能照常运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These hooks run only when this profile is applied, after the global pre-hook and before the global post-hook." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the hooks that run only when a profile is applied.",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tyto hooky se spustí po aktivaci vybraného profilu, po globálním pre-hooku a před globálním post-hookem."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Hooks werden nur ausgeführt, wenn dieses Profil angewendet wird, nach dem globalen Pre-Hook und vor dem globalen Post-Hook."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estos hooks solo se ejecutan cuando se aplica este perfil, después del pre-hook global y antes del post-hook global."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ces hooks ne s’exécutent que lorsque ce profil est appliqué, après le pre-hook global et avant le post-hook global."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ezek a hookok csak akkor futnak le, amikor ezt a profilt alkalmazod, a globális pre-hook után és a globális post-hook előtt."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hook hanya dapat dijalankan ketika profil ini diterapkan, setelah pre-hook global dan sebelum post-hook global."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These hooks run only when this profile is applied, after the global pre-hook and before the global post-hook."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These hooks run only when this profile is applied, after the global pre-hook and before the global post-hook."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 훅은 해당 프로필이 적용되어 있을 때, 전역 사전 훅 이후 그리고 전역 사후 훅 이전에만 실행됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deze hooks worden alleen uitgevoerd wanneer dit profiel wordt toegepast, na de globale pre-hook en vóór de globale post-hook."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Te hooki są uruchamiane wyłącznie w przypadku zastosowania tego profilu, po globalnym pre-hooku, a przed globalnym post-hookiem."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esses hooks são executados apenas quando este perfil é aplicado, após o gancho pré-global e antes do gancho pós-global."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Эти хуки запускаются только при применении данного профиля, после глобального pre-hook и перед глобальным post-hook"
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hooks เหล่านี้จะทำงานเฉพาะเมื่อมีการใช้โปรไฟล์นี้เท่านั้น โดยจะทำงานหลังจาก pre-hook ส่วนกลาง และก่อน post-hook ส่วนกลาง"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu hooklar, yalnızca bu profil uygulandığında, global pre-hook 'dan sonra ve global post-hook 'dan önce çalışır."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These hooks run only when this profile is applied, after the global pre-hook and before the global post-hook."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Các hook này chỉ chạy khi cấu hình này được áp dụng, sau hook pre-hook toàn cục và trước hook post-hook toàn cục."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些 Hook 仅会在应用当前配置时运行，执行顺序位于全局前置 Hook 之后、全局后置 Hook 之前。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些 Hook 僅在套用此設定檔時執行，於全域 pre-hook 之後、全域 post-hook 之前。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These run only when switching to this profile, between the scripts for every profile: after their Before switching script and before their After switching one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些脚本仅在切换到此配置方案时运行，位于所有配置方案脚本之间：在“切换前”脚本之后、“切换后”脚本之前运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
