    },
    "This backup does not include macOS's current saved menu bar layout." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此备份不包含 macOS 当前保存的菜单栏布局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This backup does not include the table the menu bar host reads today." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此备份不包含菜单栏主机今天读取的表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build of %@ makes no network calls." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此版本的 %@ 不进行网络调用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This display’s settings differ from the global template" : {
      "comment" : "Help text for the Customized badge in the Displays pane.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此显示器的设置不同于全局模板"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This macOS build is missing the system capability %@ needs to hide items." : {
      "comment" : "Refusal reason in the menu-bar-overlay warning pill: the platform cannot conceal items. Placeholder is the app name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 macOS 版本缺少 %@ 隐藏项目所需的系统能力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This macOS build is missing the system capability Thaw needs to hide items. Reordering still works; hiding does not." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 macOS 版本缺少 Thaw 隐藏项目所需的系统能力。重新排序仍可用，隐藏不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This macOS version has no menu bar agent for %@ to talk to. That agent arrived in macOS 27, and %@'s other menu bar features are unaffected." : {
      "comment" : "Caption of the empty state shown when the platform has no per-Space menu bar agent, in the Spaces settings pane. Both arguments are \\(Constants.displayName).",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 macOS 版本没有可供 %@ 通信的菜单栏代理。该代理随 macOS 27 引入，%@ 的其他菜单栏功能不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This relaunches every app with a menu bar item, so unsaved work in those apps may be lost." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这会重新启动所有带有菜单栏项目的应用，因此这些应用中未保存的工作可能会丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This session" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This session saw the layout table refuse access." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次会话中，布局表拒绝了访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This update is ready to install. Use the update window to install it now or later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此更新已准备好安装。请使用更新窗口立即或稍后安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version of macOS doesn't let %@ hide items. You can still reorder them in the bars above." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 macOS 版本不允许 %@ 隐藏项目。你仍可在上方工具栏中重新排序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will overwrite the settings of %lld displays with the global template. If the active display’s spacing changes, Thaw will relaunch each app with a menu bar item. Relaunching apps may cause unsaved input, progress, or transient app state to be lost." : {
      "comment" : "A confirmation message shown when the user is prompted to apply the global template. The argument is the number of displays that will be affected.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "This will overwrite the settings of %lld display with the global template. If the active display's spacing changes, Thaw will relaunch each app with a menu bar item. Relaunching apps may cause unsaved input, progress, or transient app state to be lost."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "This will overwrite the settings of %lld displays with the global template. If the active display’s spacing changes, Thaw will relaunch each app with a menu bar item. Relaunching apps may cause unsaved input, progress, or transient app state to be lost."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这会使用全局模板覆盖 %lld 个显示器的设置。如果活动显示器的间距发生变化，Thaw 会重新启动每个带有菜单栏项目的应用。重新启动应用可能导致未保存的输入、进度或临时状态丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will overwrite the settings of ^[%lld display](inflect: true) with the global template. If the active display’s spacing changes, Thaw will relaunch each app with a menu bar item. Relaunching apps may cause unsaved input, progress, or transient app state to be lost." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这会使用全局模板覆盖 ^[%lld display](inflect: true) 的设置。如果活动显示器的间距发生变化，Thaw 会重新启动每个带有菜单栏项目的应用。重新启动应用可能导致未保存的输入、进度或临时状态丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will reset app settings to their default values. Saved profiles, allowed apps, and user data will not be deleted. This action cannot be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这会将应用设置重置为默认值。已保存的配置方案、允许的应用和用户数据不会删除。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
