    },
    "Use a separate appearance" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用单独的外观"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use app icons instead of live previews" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用应用图标，而不是实时预览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use different settings for Light and Dark Mode" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为浅色和深色模式使用不同设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use it for an item that’s missing from the menu bar and can’t be placed there. Move it here from its menu in the layout editor. It counts as Hidden and opens from the %@ Bar.\n\nTurn this off and those items become ordinary hidden items. Your list comes back when you turn it on again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用于菜单栏中缺失且无法放置到菜单栏的项目。在布局编辑器的项目菜单中将它移到这里。它会计入“隐藏”，并从 %@ 工具栏打开。\n\n关闭此选项后，这些项目会成为普通隐藏项目。再次打开时，列表会恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use it when an app’s item is missing from the menu bar and %@ can’t place it there. To use it, move the item to Thaw Bar Only from its menu in the layout editor. %@ then treats the item as Hidden and keeps it one click away in the %@ Bar.\n\nTurn this off to treat those items as ordinary hidden items. Your list is kept and comes back when you turn it on again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Use it when an app’s item is missing from the menu bar and %1$@ can’t place it there. To use it, move the item to Thaw Bar Only from its menu in the layout editor. %2$@ then treats the item as Hidden and keeps it one click away in the %3$@ Bar.\n\nTurn this off to treat those items as ordinary hidden items. Your list is kept and comes back when you turn it on again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当应用项目缺失于菜单栏且 %@ 无法将其放置在那里时使用。在布局编辑器的项目菜单中将项目移到“仅 Thaw 工具栏”。%@ 会将项目视为“隐藏”，并将它保留在 %@ 工具栏中，点按一次即可打开。\n\n关闭此选项后，这些项目会作为普通隐藏项目处理。列表会保留，再次打开时会恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use my Mac’s readings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用我的 Mac 的读数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the app in a different language than the system." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用不同于系统语言的应用语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the app's own menu bar icon when Thaw finds one, and the app icon otherwise" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thaw 找到应用自己的菜单栏图标时使用该图标，否则使用应用图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the faster LCS algorithm for profile sorting on notched displays. It minimizes moves but may be less reliable at smaller resolutions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在带刘海的显示器上使用更快的 LCS 算法排序配置方案。它会尽量减少移动，但在较低分辨率下可能不够可靠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the full-screen menu bar appearance everywhere" : {
      "comment" : "Toggle in the Spaces settings pane that applies the full-screen menu bar appearance to every Space.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在所有位置使用全屏菜单栏外观"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the up and down buttons to reorder, and turn off a section to exclude its items from search results." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用向上和向下按钮重新排序。关闭分区后，该分区中的项目不会出现在搜索结果中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use this if macOS 27's native overflow control bleeds into the captured previews. The real menu bar is unaffected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果 macOS 27 的原生溢出控件出现在截取的预览中，请使用此选项。实际菜单栏不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Using the usual hiding for now: %@ Turn this off and on to try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目前使用常规隐藏方式：%@。请关闭后重新打开以重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
