    "With the update" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "随更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without confirmation, save spacing to" : {
      "comment" : "Label for the picker choosing which profiles receive a spacing change when relaunch confirmations are disabled.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无需确认，将间距保存到"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi‑Fi" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wi-Fi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Work" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "工作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works With Your Tools" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与你的工具协同工作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works with the apps you love" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与你常用的应用协同工作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write your saved menu bar layout straight to the system’s layout table, so reorders land without the cursor moving." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将保存的菜单栏布局直接写入系统布局表，因此重新排序时无需移动指针即可生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes a detailed log to ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/ for troubleshooting, and lists recent item moves below. Turn it off when you are done to avoid needless disk writes. Short crash reports are saved even when this is off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将详细日志写入 ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/ 以便排查问题，并在下方列出最近的项目移动记录。完成后请关闭此选项，避免不必要的磁盘写入。即使关闭此选项，也会保存简短的崩溃报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes detailed debug logs to a file for troubleshooting. Log files are saved to ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将详细调试日志写入文件，以便排查问题。日志文件保存在 ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes detailed debug logs to a file for troubleshooting. Log files are saved to ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/. Disable when not needed to avoid unnecessary disk writes." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the diagnostic logging feature.",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zaznamenává podrobné ladicí protokoly pro účely řešení problémů. Protokolové soubory se ukládají do složky ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/. Pokud to není nutné, funkci vypněte, ušetříte místo na disku."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erstellt und speichert detaillierte Protokolldateien zur Fehlersuche unter ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/. Wenn nicht benötigt, Funktion deaktivieren, um unnötige Schreibvorgänge zu vermeiden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Escribe logs de depuración detallados en un archivo para solucionar problemas. Los archivos se guardan en ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/. Deshabilita esta opción cuando no sea necesaria para evitar escrituras innecesarias en el disco."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Crée un rapport de débogage détaillé pour faciliter le dépannage. Les rapports sont enregistrés dans ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/. Désactivez cette option lorsqu'elle n'est pas nécessaire afin d'éviter des écritures disque inutiles."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Részletes hibakeresési naplókat ír fájlba a hibaelhárításhoz. A naplófájlok a ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/ könyvtárba kerülnek mentésre. Kapcsolja ki, ha nincs rá szükség, a felesleges lemezírások elkerülése érdekében."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Menulis log debug terperinci ke berkas untuk membantu pemecahan masalah. Berkas log disimpan di ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/. Nonaktifkan saat tidak dibutuhkan untuk menghindari penulisan disk yang tidak perlu."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scrive log di debug dettagliati in un file per la risoluzione dei problemi. I file di log vengono salvati in ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/. Disattivare quando non necessario per evitare scritture su disco non necessarie."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "トラブルシューティング用に詳細なデバッグログをファイルに書き込みます。ログファイルは ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/ に保存されます。不要な場合は無効にして、余計なディスク書き込みを避けてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "문제 해결을 위해 자세한 디버그 로그를 파일에 기록합니다. 로그 파일은 ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/에 저장됩니다. 불필요한 디스크 쓰기를 방지하려면 필요하지 않을 때 비활성화하세요."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schrijft gedetailleerde foutopsporingslogboeken naar een bestand voor probleemoplossing. Logbestanden worden opgeslagen in ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/. Schakel deze functie uit wanneer deze niet nodig is om onnodige schrijfbewerkingen op de schijf te voorkomen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tworzy szczegółowe dzienniki zdarzeń ułatwiające diagnostykę błędów. Pliki te znajdziesz w katalogu ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/. Wyłącz tę funkcję, jeśli z niej nie korzystasz, by ograniczyć zużycie dysku."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Grava logs detalhados de depuração em um arquivo para ajudar na solução de problemas. Os arquivos de log são salvos em ~/Biblioteca/Logs/Thaw/. Desative quando não for necessário para evitar gravações desnecessárias no disco."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Записывает подробные журналы отладки в файл для устранения неполадок. Файлы журналов сохраняются в ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/. Отключите, если не нужно, чтобы избежать лишних записей на диск."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "บันทึกข้อมูลการแก้ไขข้อผิดพลาดอย่างละเอียดลงในไฟล์เพื่อใช้ในการแก้ไขปัญหา ไฟล์บันทึกจะถูกบันทึกไว้ที่ ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/. ให้ปิดใช้งานในส่วนนี้เมื่อไม่จำเป็น เพื่อหลีกเลี่ยงการเขียนข้อมูลลงดิสก์โดยไม่จำเป็น"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sorun giderme için ayrıntılı hata ayıklama günlüklerini bir dosyaya yazar. Günlük dosyaları ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/ konumuna kaydedilir. Gereksiz disk yazmalarından kaçınmak için kullanılmadığında devre dışı bırakın."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Записує детальні журнали налагодження у файл для розв'язання проблем. Файли журналів зберігаються в ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/. Вимикайте, коли це не потрібно, щоб уникнути зайвого запису на диск."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ghi nhật ký gỡ lỗi chi tiết vào một tệp để khắc phục sự cố. Các tệp nhật ký được lưu vào ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/. Tắt khi không cần thiết để tránh việc ghi đĩa không cần thiết."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将详细的调试日志写入文件以便进行故障排除。日志文件保存在 ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/ 目录下。如果不需要此功能，请禁用它以避免不必要的磁盘写入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將詳細的除錯記錄寫入檔案以進行疑難排解。記錄檔儲存於 ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/。不需要時請停用，以避免不必要的磁碟寫入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes detailed debug logs to a file for troubleshooting. Log files are saved to ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/. Disable when not needed to avoid unnecessary disk writes. Compact crash diagnostics are saved even when this is off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将详细调试日志写入文件，以便排查问题。日志文件保存在 ~/Library/Logs/Thaw/。不需要时请关闭此选项，避免不必要的磁盘写入。即使关闭此选项，也会保存简要崩溃诊断信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change this anytime from the ⋯ menu in Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Footnote under the onboarding Simple-or-Full choice; ⋯ is the settings toolbar overflow button.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你随时可以在设置中的 ⋯ 菜单更改此选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can remove apps from this list at any time to revoke their access." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how to remove apps from the allowed apps list.",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikace můžete z tohoto seznamu kdykoli odstranit a tím jim odebrat přístup."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Anwendungen können von dieser Liste jederzeit gelöscht und deren Berechtigungen damit wieder entzogen werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puedes eliminar aplicaciones de esta lista en cualquier momento para revocar su acceso."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous pouvez à tout moment supprimer des applications de cette liste pour leur retirer l'accès."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bármikor eltávolíthatsz alkalmazásokat erről a listáról a hozzáférésük visszavonásához."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi dapat dihapus dari daftar ini kapan saja untuk mengubah akses."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puoi rimuovere le applicazioni da questa lista in qualsiasi momento e revocare i loro accessi."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このリストからアプリをいつでも削除することで、そのアクセス権を取り消すことができます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 목록에서 앱을 언제든지 삭제하여 액세스를 취소할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je kunt apps op elk moment uit deze lijst verwijderen om hun toegang in te trekken."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Możesz usunąć aplikacje z tej listy w dowolnym momencie, aby odebrać im dostęp."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Você pode remover aplicativos desta lista a qualquer momento para revogar o acesso deles."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Вы можете удалить приложения из этого списка в любое время, чтобы отменить их доступ."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "คุณสามารถลบแอปออกจากรายการนี้ได้ตลอดเวลาเพื่อเพิกถอนสิทธิ์การเข้าถึง"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu listedeki uygulamaları erişimlerini iptal etmek için istediğiniz zaman kaldırabilirsiniz."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You can remove apps from this list at any time to revoke their access."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bạn có thể xóa ứng dụng khỏi danh sách này bất kỳ lúc nào để thu hồi quyền truy cập của chúng."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您可随时将应用从列表中移除，以取消其访问权限。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您可以隨時從列表中移除應用程式以撤銷其存取權限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can test this in the 2.1.0 beta. It lands in this version once that testing ends." : {
      "comment" : "Caption of the Scripts pane placeholder.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可以在 2.1.0 beta 中测试此功能。测试结束后，它会加入此版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You haven't clicked %@ in 30 days. Moving it to Hidden frees room in your menu bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你已经 30 天没有点按 %@。将它移到“隐藏”可以为菜单栏腾出空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You haven't clicked %@ in 30 days. Moving them to Hidden frees room in your menu bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你已经 30 天没有点按 %@。将它们移到“隐藏”可以为菜单栏腾出空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You set the order yourself by ⌘-dragging items in the menu bar. Thaw still hides and shows items, but never moves them or changes the order macOS has saved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你通过在菜单栏中按住 ⌘ 拖动项目来设置顺序。Thaw 仍会隐藏和显示项目，但不会移动项目，也不会更改 macOS 保存的顺序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're All Set" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一切就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your design is saved automatically. The menu bar preview does not change Apple's icons." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的设计会自动保存。菜单栏预览不会更改 Apple 的图标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your menu bar" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的菜单栏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your menu bar changes as you edit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "菜单栏会随着编辑而变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your menu bar’s shape, colors and border go back to the defaults. This can’t be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "菜单栏的形状、颜色和边框会恢复为默认值。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your pointer never moves: the saved layout is updated and the menu bar re-sorts itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "指针不会移动：保存的布局会更新，菜单栏会自动重新排序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
