    },
    "macOS 27 currently prevents Thaw from hiding some system items. Support is still a work in progress, and future macOS updates may change this behavior before Thaw can provide a complete solution. This limitation is already known, so no bug report is needed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 27 目前阻止 Thaw 隐藏某些系统项目。支持仍在开发中，未来的 macOS 更新可能会在 Thaw 提供完整解决方案前改变此行为。此限制已知，无需提交错误报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 27 does not let %@ hide some system items." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 27 不允许 %@ 隐藏某些系统项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 27 does not let %@ hide some system items. This is known, so no bug report is needed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 27 不允许 %@ 隐藏某些系统项目。此问题已知，无需提交错误报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 27 draws them itself instead of letting each one place its own icon, so %@ has to ask macOS to move them rather than moving them directly. Some refuse to move, some return to Visible on their own, and Clock and Control Center can only be hidden together with Siri." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 27 会自行绘制这些项目，不让每个项目放置自己的图标，因此 %@ 必须请求 macOS 移动它们，不能直接移动。有些项目拒绝移动，有些会自行回到“显示”，而“时钟”和“控制中心”只能与 Siri 一起隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 27 draws them itself instead of letting each one place its own icon, so Thaw has to ask the system to move them rather than moving them directly. Some refuse to move, some return to Visible on their own, and Clock and Control Center can only be hidden together with Siri." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 27 会自行绘制这些项目，不让每个项目放置自己的图标，因此 Thaw 必须请求系统移动它们，不能直接移动。有些项目拒绝移动，有些会自行回到“显示”，而“时钟”和“控制中心”只能与 Siri 一起隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 27 preferred" : {
      "comment" : "Small pill next to the menu bar layout reset tool marking it as the preferred reset on macOS 27.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 27 优先"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS already uses this shortcut" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 已使用此快捷键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS didn't apply that change. Try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 未应用此更改。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS didn’t apply every move in %@. The group’s saved order is correct and %@ will try again." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation shown when a group reorder did not converge",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS didn’t apply every move in %1$@. The group’s saved order is correct and %2$@ will try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 未应用 %@ 中的所有移动。分组的保存顺序正确，%@ 会重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS didn’t apply every move in %@. The group’s saved order is correct and Thaw will retry." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation shown when a group reorder did not converge",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 未应用 %@ 中的所有移动。分组的保存顺序正确，Thaw 会重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS doesn’t allow this item to leave its place in the menu bar." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation shown when an item cannot be assigned to a section",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 不允许此项目离开菜单栏中的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS doesn’t let %@ hide “%@”." : {
      "comment" : "Reason a group move was refused: hiding unsupported for this app",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS doesn’t let %1$@ hide “%2$@”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 不允许 %@ 隐藏“%@”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS doesn’t show this setting anywhere, so %@ can’t read your current value. This starts at a default instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 没有在任何位置显示此设置，因此 %@ 无法读取当前值。系统会从默认值开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS draws the menu bar solid while it's on, which covers this look. Turn it off to see your changes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 开启此功能时会以纯色绘制菜单栏，覆盖此外观。请关闭它以查看更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS gives %@ this state for as long as it is running. Everything on this page reverts when %@ quits, and none of it is saved to your settings or profiles." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the session-scope notice in the Spaces settings pane. Both arguments are \\(Constants.displayName).",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只要 %@ 正在运行，macOS 就会让它保持此状态。%@ 退出后，此页面上的所有内容都会恢复，任何更改都不会保存到设置或配置方案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS hides Focus, AirDrop, Now Playing and Fast User Switching whenever any other item is hidden, even in Visible. %@ puts its own icon in each one’s place, with the main actions in its menu. You can move or hide it like any item.\n\nTurn this off to bring the originals back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只要有其他项目隐藏，macOS 就会隐藏“专注模式”、“隔空投送”、“正在播放”和“快速用户切换”，即使这些项目位于“显示”中也是如此。%@ 会在它们的位置放置自己的图标，并在菜单中提供主要操作。你可以像操作其他项目一样移动或隐藏它。\n\n关闭此选项可恢复原来的项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS hides Focus, AirDrop, Now Playing and Fast User Switching whenever any other item is hidden, even in Visible. This puts a %@ icon in each one's place, with its main actions in the menu, and you can move or hide it like any other item. Turn this off to bring the originals back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只要有其他项目隐藏，macOS 就会隐藏“专注模式”、“隔空投送”、“正在播放”和“快速用户切换”，即使这些项目位于“显示”中也是如此。此选项会在它们的位置放置 %@ 图标，并在菜单中提供主要操作。你可以像操作其他项目一样移动或隐藏它。关闭此选项可恢复原来的项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS hides this icon while other icons are hidden because its app has no registered identity." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其他图标隐藏时，macOS 会隐藏此图标，因为它所属的应用没有注册身份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS isn’t showing “%@” in the menu bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 未在菜单栏中显示“%@”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS keeps it in a protected folder, so a backup holds only the older preference files beside it. Grant Menu Bar Layout Access on the Privacy page to back up and restore the whole layout." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 将它保存在受保护的文件夹中，因此备份只能保存旁边较旧的偏好设置文件。请在“隐私”页面授予“菜单栏布局访问权限”，以备份和恢复完整布局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS keeps that layout in one protected file (~/Library/Group Containers/com.apple.MenuBar). %@ reads it to place items and writes it only when you reorder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 将该布局保存在一个受保护的文件中（~/Library/Group Containers/com.apple.MenuBar）。%@ 读取它来放置项目，只在你重新排序时写入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS offers no way to see that another app is recording the screen, so recordings are not covered." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 没有提供查看其他应用是否正在录制屏幕的方法，因此无法涵盖录屏状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS prohibits “%@” from being moved." : {
      "comment" : "The text that appears below the main message text in the alert displayed when a menu bar item is not movable.",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS nepovoluje přesunout „%@“."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS verhindert, dass %@ bewegt wird."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS no permite mover “%@”."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS empêche le déplacement de « %@ »."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A macOS megtiltja a(z) „%@” mozgatását."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS melarang \"%@\" untuk digerakkan."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS impedisce lo spostamento di \"%@\"."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS により \"%@\" は移動できません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS에서 \"%@\"의 이동을 금지합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS verbiedt het verplaatsen van “%@”."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "System macOS uniemożliwia przeniesienie \"%@\"."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O macOS proíbe que “%@” seja movido."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS запрещает перемещение «%@»."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS ห้ามไม่ให้ \"%@\" ถูกย้าย"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS \"%@\" öğesinin taşınmasını engelliyor."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS забороняє переміщення «%@»."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS cấm di chuyển \"%@\"."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 禁止移动“%@”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 禁止移動「%@」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS protects its saved menu bar layout. Grant Menu Bar Layout Access on the Privacy page to compare it with %@'s saved layout." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 保护其保存的菜单栏布局。请在“隐私”页面授予“菜单栏布局访问权限”，以便将它与 %@ 保存的布局进行比较。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS refused access to its saved menu bar layout this session. Grant Menu Bar Layout Access on the Privacy page." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 在本次会话中拒绝访问保存的菜单栏布局。请在“隐私”页面授予“菜单栏布局访问权限”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS requires %@ to make itself visible in the Dock while this setting is in effect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此设置生效期间，macOS 要求 %@ 在程序坞中显示自身。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS won't let %@ switch this app off, so its icon stays on the bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 不允许 %@ 关闭此应用，因此它的图标会留在工具栏中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS's saved layout, by position" : {
      "localizations" : {
