          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Little Snitch is running, but %@ can’t read its menu bar item. Check “Allow GUI Scripting access to Little Snitch” in Little Snitch’s Security settings. If it is already on, the item may be unavailable through Accessibility; try restarting Little Snitch and then this app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Little Snitch 正在运行，但 %@ 无法读取其菜单栏项目。请在 Little Snitch 的安全性设置中检查“允许 GUI Scripting 访问 Little Snitch”。如果已开启，该项目可能无法通过辅助功能访问；请尝试重新启动 Little Snitch，然后重新启动此应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Native keeps Live Activities, the camera indicator and Apple’s own items on the menu bar. Standard hides any app’s items. Everything also hides Clock, Control Center and Siri." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统模式会将实时活动、相机指示器和 Apple 自带的项目保留在菜单栏中。标准模式会隐藏任何应用的项目。全部模式还会隐藏时钟、控制中心和 Siri。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No apps found" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有找到应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No other apps are available for recovery. If an item is still missing, check its switch in System Settings → Menu Bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有其他可用于恢复的应用。如果项目仍然缺失，请在系统设置 → 菜单栏中检查对应的开关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No triggers yet" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "尚无触发器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Normal hiding is stopped in this window. Recovery changes app visibility only, not your saved layout or positions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此窗口中已停止普通隐藏。恢复操作只会更改应用可见性，不会更改保存的布局或位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not currently in the menu bar" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前不在菜单栏中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing Playing" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有正在播放的内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Little Snitch" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开 Little Snitch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open recovery from Troubleshooting so normal hiding can stop first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请从故障排除中打开恢复，让普通隐藏先停止。"
