    "Pop Out Editor" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "弹出编辑器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puts Thaw icons in place of Focus, AirDrop, Now Playing, Fast User Switching, Time Machine and the Input menu, so you can move or hide them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用 Thaw 图标替代专注模式、隔空投送、正在播放、快速用户切换、时间机器和输入法菜单，这样你就能移动或隐藏它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit Recovery" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "退出恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit Thaw and Open Recovery" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "退出 Thaw 并打开恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read and write access was not granted. Try again or restore the app switches in System Settings → Menu Bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未授予读写权限。请重试，或在系统设置 → 菜单栏中恢复应用开关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recorded changes to restore" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已记录的待恢复更改"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recovery records are kept until the visibility settings are verified. You can also enable the affected apps in System Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢复记录会保留到可见性设置完成验证。你也可以在系统设置中启用受影响的应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove Trigger" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "移除触发器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove trigger for %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "移除 %@ 的触发器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset Triggers" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重置触发器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore Visibility" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢复可见性"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore Visibility…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢复可见性……"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore app visibility without resetting saved positions or section assignments." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢复应用可见性，不重置保存的位置或分区分配。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore missing menu bar items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢复缺失的菜单栏项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore recorded states and enable the apps you selected. Your saved layout and positions will not be changed. Native hiding stays off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢复记录的状态并启用你选择的应用。不会更改保存的布局和位置。系统隐藏会保持关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save Trigger" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保存触发器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved item positions were reset. Relaunching…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保存的项目位置已重置。正在重新启动……"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved triggers could not be read and have not been changed. Resetting removes only these trigger rules." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取已保存的触发器，触发器没有更改。重置只会移除这些触发器规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved triggers could not be read. They have not been changed. Reset triggers to start again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取已保存的触发器。触发器没有更改。请重置触发器后重新开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select “group.com.apple.controlcenter.plist” to restore app visibility. Recovery will not change saved item positions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择“group.com.apple.controlcenter.plist”以恢复应用可见性。恢复不会更改保存的项目位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show Hidden Apps" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示隐藏的应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show selected menu bar items while an app runs, even in the background. When it quits, the items follow their saved layout again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用运行时显示选定的菜单栏项目，即使应用在后台运行。应用退出后，项目会再次遵循保存的布局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch to the Full %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切换到完整 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app could not be selected. Try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法选择该应用。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The trigger could not be saved. Try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法保存触发器。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On Accessibility for the Full %@…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为完整 %@ 打开辅助功能……"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wait until next restart (no apps restarted)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等到下次重新启动（不会重新启动应用）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for app to launch" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待应用启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While %@ is running" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 运行时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS may also show other menu bar items from the same app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 也可能显示同一应用的其他菜单栏项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ are running, but %@ can't see their menu bar items, so it can't hide or arrange them. If their icons are missing from the menu bar too, quit and reopen them. Otherwise, relaunch %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 正在运行，但 %@ 看不到它们的菜单栏项目，因此无法隐藏或排列这些项目。如果它们的图标也不在菜单栏中，请退出并重新打开这些应用。否则，请重新启动 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ can't hide or arrange anything until it is switched back on in System Settings > Menu Bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在系统设置 > 菜单栏中重新打开此选项前，%@ 无法隐藏或排列任何项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ couldn't read Control Center's settings at launch, so apps it hid earlier weren't shown again. Restore them from Tools." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 启动时无法读取控制中心的设置，因此之前隐藏的应用没有重新显示。请从“工具”中恢复它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is running, but %@ can't see its menu bar items, so it can't hide or arrange them. If its icon is missing from the menu bar too, quit and reopen %@. Otherwise, relaunch %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 正在运行，但 %@ 看不到它的菜单栏项目，因此无法隐藏或排列这些项目。如果它的图标也不在菜单栏中，请退出并重新打开 %@。否则，请重新启动 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld°" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld°"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Apple’s own items:** macOS hides Focus, AirDrop, Now Playing and Fast User Switching whenever any other item is hidden, and never hides Time Machine or the Input menu. Turn on Replace Control Center items further down this page to put %@ icons in their place, which you can move and hide." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Apple 自己的项目：**只要有其他项目隐藏，macOS 就会隐藏“专注模式”、“隔空投送”、“正在播放”和“快速用户切换”，但不会隐藏“时间机器”或“输入法”菜单。在本页下方打开“替代控制中心项目”，即可用 %@ 图标替代它们，并移动或隐藏这些图标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0° runs top to bottom, 90° left to right" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "0° 表示从上到下，90° 表示从左到右"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Angle" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "角度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applying writes the new spacing without restarting apps; the new spacing appears the next time each menu bar app starts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用设置会写入新的间距，但不会重新启动应用；每个菜单栏应用下次启动时会显示新的间距。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps pick up the new spacing the next time they start" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用会在下次启动时读取新的间距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking asks %@ whether a newer version exists. Downloading also fetches it in the background; without it, the download starts only after you accept an update. The release notes shown with an update come from the same server." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查会询问 %@ 是否有新版本。启用下载后，也会在后台获取新版本；关闭下载后，只有在你接受更新时才会开始下载。更新中显示的发行说明也来自同一服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking menu bar visibility…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在检查菜单栏可见性……"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choosing that file gives %@ access to it alone. Without it, %@ moves items with the pointer, which takes over your cursor while it works. You may need to quit and reopen %@ before it takes effect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择该文件后，%@ 只能访问此文件。没有此权限时，%@ 会使用指针移动项目，操作期间会接管你的指针。设置生效前，你可能需要退出并重新打开 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disabled" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已停用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every menu bar item's saved position will be deleted and the menu bar will restart, so your whole arrangement is rebuilt from scratch. A backup is saved first, and Layout backups on this page can put it back. %@ relaunches afterward." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个菜单栏项目的保存位置都会删除，菜单栏会重新启动，并从头重建整个布局。系统会先保存备份，你可以使用本页的布局备份恢复布局。之后 %@ 会重新启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全部"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grant Access to Restore Menu Bar Items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "授予恢复菜单栏项目的访问权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide whole apps from a menu. Arranging items, the %@ Bar and search stay off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从菜单中隐藏整个应用。项目排列、%@ 工具栏和搜索会保持关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hides any app’s items, and Clock, Control Center and Siri too.\nWhile they’re hidden, macOS also removes Live Activities and the camera indicator." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隐藏所有应用的项目，以及“时钟”、“控制中心”和 Siri。\n这些项目隐藏时，macOS 也会移除实时活动和摄像头指示器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hides any app’s items.\nWhile they’re hidden, macOS also removes Live Activities and the camera indicator." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隐藏所有应用的项目。\n这些项目隐藏时，macOS 也会移除实时活动和摄像头指示器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hiding" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隐藏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hiding method" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隐藏方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It also stops hidden items from flashing when Notification Center opens. Choosing the file gives %@ access to it alone. You may need to quit and reopen %@ before it takes effect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它还会阻止隐藏项目在通知中心打开时闪烁。选择该文件后，%@ 只能访问此文件。设置生效前，你可能需要退出并重新打开 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Item arrangement is set to Manual, so an item's section is the side of the dividers it sits on. ⌘-drag it past a divider in the menu bar, or switch to Automatic in Settings %@ Layout." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "项目排列方式已设为“手动”，项目所在分区由它所在分隔线的一侧决定。请在菜单栏中按住 ⌘ 将它拖过分隔线，或在设置 %@ 布局中切换为“自动”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Items move into place without your pointer moving, because %@ updates macOS's saved menu bar layout. It touches only that one file. You may need to quit and reopen %@ before it takes effect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 更新 macOS 保存的菜单栏布局，因此项目可以在不移动指针的情况下归位。它只会访问这一个文件。设置生效前，你可能需要退出并重新打开 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s one of Apple’s own items, which macOS keeps in the menu bar unless %@ asks it not to. Choose Everything under Hiding method in Settings %@ Layout to move it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是 Apple 自己的项目。除非 %@ 请求隐藏，否则 macOS 会将它保留在菜单栏中。要移动它，请在设置 %@ 布局的“隐藏方式”下选择“全部”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps Live Activities and the camera indicator visible while apps are hidden, and helps with hidden items flashing when Notification Center opens. You may need to quit and reopen %@ before it takes effect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用隐藏时保留实时活动和摄像头指示器，并减少隐藏项目在通知中心打开时闪烁的情况。设置生效前，你可能需要退出并重新打开 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps Live Activities, the camera indicator and Apple’s own items on the menu bar.\nCan’t hide Clock, Control Center or Siri. macOS may show the screen recording indicator." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将实时活动、摄像头指示器和 Apple 自己的项目保留在菜单栏中。\n无法隐藏“时钟”、“控制中心”或 Siri。macOS 可能会显示屏幕录制指示器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Menu Bar Visibility Recovery" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "菜单栏可见性恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Missing menu bar items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "缺失的菜单栏项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move it in the menu bar" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在菜单栏中移动它"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Native" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off, Check only, or Check and download. Checking asks the update server whether a newer version exists." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭、仅检查，或检查并下载。检查会询问更新服务器是否有新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Menu Bar Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开菜单栏设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Tools" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开工具"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open visibility recovery?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要打开可见性恢复吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens the experimental reorder editor in its own window." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在独立窗口中打开实验性重新排序编辑器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit other copies of Thaw and Bartender before continuing. Recovery records have been kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "继续前，请退出 Thaw 和 Bartender 的其他副本。恢复记录已保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Relaunch %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重新启动 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove this trigger?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要移除此触发器吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset all triggers?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要重置所有触发器吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restarting apps applies the change now; waiting leaves every app running and the new spacing appears the next time each app starts (after a restart, or when you reopen it)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "立即重新启动应用可马上应用更改；等待则会让所有应用继续运行，新的间距会在每个应用下次启动时显示（重新启动或重新打开应用后）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore Missing Items…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢复缺失项目……"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore app visibility without resetting your layout. Normal hiding stops while a separate recovery window is open." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恢复应用可见性，但不重置布局。单独的恢复窗口打开期间，常规隐藏会暂停。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore these visibility settings?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要恢复这些可见性设置吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved item positions were reset. Backup saved as %@. Relaunching…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已重置保存的项目位置。备份已保存为 %@。正在重新启动……"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved triggers unavailable" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已保存的触发器不可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show items while an app runs" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用运行时显示项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show these menu bar items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示这些菜单栏项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some apps may still be hidden" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "某些应用可能仍会隐藏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Standard" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "标准模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Takes effect when this display is the active menu bar display. Applying it writes the new value without restarting apps; each app picks it up the next time it starts, and each app can add its own padding, so gaps are not always identical." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此显示器成为活动菜单栏显示器后生效。应用此设置会写入新值，但不会重新启动应用；每个应用会在下次启动时读取新值，也可能添加自己的内边距，因此间隙不一定完全相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thaw has no recovery record for these apps. Select only the ones you want to allow in the menu bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thaw 没有这些应用的恢复记录。请只选择你想允许显示在菜单栏中的应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thaw will quit normal mode so neither hiding mechanism can interfere. Your saved layout is kept. Native hiding will remain off after recovery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thaw 会退出普通模式，避免两种隐藏机制相互干扰。你保存的布局会保留。恢复后，系统模式隐藏仍会关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ icon isn't in the menu bar" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 图标不在菜单栏中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will overwrite the settings of ^[%lld display](inflect: true) with the global template. If the active display’s spacing changes, the new spacing appears the next time each menu bar app starts, and apps are not restarted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这会使用全局模板覆盖 ^[%lld 个显示器](inflect: true) 的设置。如果活动显示器的间距发生变化，每个菜单栏应用下次启动时会显示新的间距，应用不会重新启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Triggers" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "触发器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Using Standard for now: %@ Choose Standard and then Native to try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目前使用标准模式：%@。请先选择“标准模式”，再选择“系统模式”以重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Visibility settings were saved and verified. Quit recovery and check your menu bar before reopening Thaw. Native hiding remains off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可见性设置已保存并验证。请退出恢复功能，检查菜单栏后再重新打开 Thaw。系统模式隐藏仍会关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When applying spacing" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用间距时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When this app runs" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此应用运行时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You set the order yourself by ⌘-dragging items in the menu bar. Thaw still hides and shows items, but only moves an item when you arrange it in Layout." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你通过在菜单栏中按住 ⌘ 拖动项目来设置顺序。Thaw 仍会隐藏和显示项目，但只有你在布局中排列项目时才会移动项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS hides Focus, AirDrop, Now Playing and Fast User Switching whenever any other item is hidden, and never hides Time Machine or the Input menu. This puts a %@ icon in each one’s place that does the same things, and you can move or hide it like any other item. Turn this off to bring the originals back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只要有其他项目隐藏，macOS 就会隐藏“专注模式”、“隔空投送”、“正在播放”和“快速用户切换”，但不会隐藏“时间机器”或“输入法”菜单。此选项会在它们的位置放置 %@ 图标，并提供相同操作；你可以像操作其他项目一样移动或隐藏这些图标。关闭此选项可恢复原来的项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS isn't allowing %@ in the menu bar" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 不允许 %@ 显示在菜单栏中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS may be blocking it. Check that %@ is switched on in System Settings > Menu Bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 可能阻止了此操作。请检查 %@ 是否已在系统设置 > 菜单栏中打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS only reads menu bar spacing when a status item’s owner starts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 只会在状态项目所属应用启动时读取菜单栏间距。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS takes pinned Control Center items like this one off the menu bar while other icons are hidden. It comes back when you show them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其他图标隐藏时，macOS 会将此类固定的控制中心项目从菜单栏移除。显示隐藏项目后，它会恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.1"
}
